          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On December 25, 2014, around 7:15 PM, two individuals were intrigued by the movements of a glowing trail in the clear night sky. The phenomenon suddenly disappeared. No unusual noises were heard. A third person in the village also made the observation. Only one questionnaire was collected. Based on the information gathered during the investigation (see the report), this case should be classified as \"B\" as a probable observation of a flying object of the type Thai lantern under particular meteorological conditions (wind). The GEIPAN did not conduct searches to identify the source of this release, therefore, the given explanation is only very probable, but not certain.",
